<title>USA: Grow Biz extends share repurchase.</title>
<headline>Grow Biz extends share repurchase.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grow Biz International Inc said Wednesday it extended its common stock buy-back by another 500,000 shares, to be purchased from time to time on the open market.</p>
<p>Grow Biz, which develops and franchises retail concepts for second-hand merchandise, said it was nearing completion of its previously announced buy-back of 1,500,000 shares.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
